cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the original upstream publication
  (Piovesan et al., 2024) as the primary reference. This fork is a modified
  derivative work and is not a replacement for the upstream citation.
type: software
title: "cafaeval (PROTEA fork)"
abstract: >-
  Modified fork of CAFA-evaluator-PK providing performance optimizations
  for local iteration in the PROTEA thesis project. Scoring semantics
  (Fmax, Smin, weighted variants, Partial-Knowledge evaluation) are
  preserved and validated against the unmodified upstream.
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/claradepaolis/CAFA-evaluator-PK"
url: "https://github.com/BioComputingUP/CAFA-evaluator"

preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    CAFA-evaluator: A Python Tool for Benchmarking Ontological
    Classification Methods
  authors:
